{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"这一次，欢喜变得更热切，他开始想比眼下再靠近对方一点。因为亲近已经带来真实满足，他对更深的亲近有了切身渴望。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"真实的满足使他不只想延续现有的亲近，也开始渴望更深地靠近对方。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"听感中的热度与迫切感支持渴望增强，而此前获得的真实满足为进一步靠近提供了明确的经历依据。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"这一次，怅然落在眼前这一刻：他越享受亲近，越舍不得此刻过去。因为他早已盼望这份亲近延续，眼前的美好也让他更在意时间正在流逝。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始留恋亲近中的每个当下，时光流逝本身也会触动他。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"听感记录明确指出美好仍在而时间正在经过，前文对亲近持续的期待也能解释他为何开始留恋每一个当下。\",\n      \"uses\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "21a7b01a-8b0c-4623-85b2-bf6d3231fa52", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T021010323667Z", "elapsed_seconds": 123.422, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:12:13.770606+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c19f8946b3b05615aebaa4538fc66754d6c9f0c71e55974af23c686603342899", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614